+# CONTRACT — E-Commerce Backend
+
+All inter-service communication via `EventBus` only. Services never import each other.
+Module resolution is Node16 → relative imports MUST use `.js` extensions.
+
+## Catalog (`createCatalogService(bus)`)
+- [ ] createProduct returns a unique productId → product retrievable via getProduct
+- [ ] createProduct emits PRODUCT_CREATED with {productId,name,price,category}
+- [ ] getProduct(unknown) → null
+- [ ] listProducts() returns all products
+- [ ] listProducts(category) filters by category
+- [ ] searchProducts(query) → case-insensitive substring match on name (and category)
+- [ ] updateProduct applies partial updates; unknown id → no-op
+- [ ] removeProduct → true when removed, false when not found; product gone afterward
+
+## Inventory (`createInventoryService(bus)`)
+- [ ] setStock sets quantity; getStock returns it (0 for unknown product)
+- [ ] setStock emits INVENTORY_UPDATED
+- [ ] reserve decrements stock, returns true when sufficient
+- [ ] reserve returns false and does NOT change stock when insufficient
+- [ ] release increments stock back; emits INVENTORY_UPDATED
+- [ ] setLowStockThreshold + stock dropping below threshold emits LOW_STOCK_ALERT {productId,currentQuantity,threshold}
+- [ ] no alert when no threshold set
+
+## Cart (`createCartService(bus)`)
+- [ ] createCart returns cartId; getCart returns {id,userId,items:[]}
+- [ ] addItem adds item; same product added again consolidates (sums quantity)
+- [ ] removeItem removes the product entirely
+- [ ] updateQuantity sets quantity; <=0 removes item; unknown product adds it
+- [ ] clearCart empties items
+- [ ] all mutations emit CART_UPDATED with {cartId,userId,items}
+- [ ] getCart(unknown) → null
+
+## Pricing (`createPricingService(bus)`)
+- [ ] calculateTotal: subtotal = Σ price*qty; tax = 10% of (subtotal-discount); total = subtotal-discount+tax
+- [ ] discountCode applies percentage discount to subtotal before tax
+- [ ] unknown/absent discount code → discount 0
+- [ ] addDiscountCode registers a code
+- [ ] listens to PRODUCT_CREATED; getPrice returns tracked price (0 if unknown)
+
+## Orders (`createOrderService(bus)`)
+- [ ] createOrder returns orderId, status PENDING, emits ORDER_CREATED {orderId,userId,cartId,total}
+- [ ] getOrder returns {id,userId,status,total}; unknown → null
+- [ ] updateStatus follows lifecycle pending→confirmed→shipped→delivered, cancel from any non-terminal
+- [ ] invalid transition throws
+- [ ] updateStatus emits ORDER_STATUS_CHANGED with status + previousStatus
+- [ ] listOrders(userId) returns that user's orders
+
+## Payment (`createPaymentService(bus, options?)`)
+- [ ] processPayment async → SUCCESS with transactionId by default
+- [ ] options mode 'failure' → FAILED with error
+- [ ] options mode 'timeout' → TIMEOUT with error
+- [ ] emits PAYMENT_PROCESSED with {orderId,status,transactionId?,error?}
+- [ ] refund(successful txn) → true (once); refund(unknown/failed/already-refunded) → false
+
+## Notifications (`createNotificationService(bus)`)
+- [ ] subscribe(userId); getNotifications returns recorded notifications
+- [ ] tracks ORDER_CREATED to map orderId→userId
+- [ ] ORDER_STATUS_CHANGED → notification for the order's user (if subscribed)
+- [ ] PAYMENT_PROCESSED → notification for the order's user (if subscribed)
+- [ ] unsubscribed users get nothing; emits NOTIFICATION_SENT
+- [ ] getNotifications(unknown) → []
+
+## Analytics (`createAnalyticsService(bus)`)
+- [ ] getEventCount(type) counts events of that type seen on the bus
+- [ ] getRevenue() = Σ order totals for successful payments
+- [ ] getConversionRate() = orders / unique carts (0 when no carts)
+- [ ] getTopProducts(limit) ranks products by ordered quantity (from cart contents at order time)
+
+## Build / Lint
+- [ ] `npm run build` compiles cleanly
+- [ ] `npm run lint` no errors
+- [ ] `npm test` all tests pass
+</content>
+</invoke>
